      "endLine": 31,
      "doc": "Social Reel — generic short-form social video player promo A neutral \"vertical video player\" UI (avatar / handle / like-comment-share rail / progress bar) wrapped in a landscape stage, cycling through a catch-copy -> second-copy -> info-panel -> CTA sequence. Motion preserved from the source template: - FadeIn-up entrances (opacity + translateY via interpolate) - AccentLine scaleX wipe (left/center grow) - PulseButton sin-wave scale pulse on the CTA after a spring entrance - Ken-Burns slow zoom on the backdrop Self-contained: react / remotion only, Latin system fonts, no external CDN, no brand colors/logos/wordmarks — fully fictional (\"Streamly\" / @aria.studio)."
